      <img src="/snapshots/eol-fixer/automatching.svg" alt="Automatching flow: material name is normalised, matched against the material library (most specific part first, typo-tolerant, barred terms blocked), producing a suggestion with confidence and reason, which the modeller accepts or overrides with enforced reasoning." />
      <figcaption>The automatching flow: deterministic matcher, human decision, everything reported.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </details>

